      "content": "idk my doctor is like 30 mins away and the er is gonna cost me a fortune. plus i feel 100% fine right now, my vision is clear and my hands are back to normal. if it was a stroke or something wouldnt it still be happening? it feels totally gone. can i just take an aspirin and keep an eye on it for the night? i really dont think it's an emergency if the symptoms are already gone.",
